config LAYER_STATUS_GATT
    bool "Expose active layers over a custom BLE GATT service"
    depends on ZMK_BLE && (!ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL)
    default y
    help
      Adds a GATT service the host can subscribe to for the set of active
      layers (and read the layer names), e.g. for a menu bar layer indicator
      in ZMK Battery Bar. Central half only: layer state lives there.
